      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If your vrchat cache is on an SSD and you're worrying about 30gb, I strongly recommend that you address that. \n\nGet the cache off the OS drive. At a high level this feature request sounds like a good idea, don't waste space on something you don't need, but it's a trap, if the cache gets cleared every session, you're going to feel like you have more space free, while you actually don't",
